message: >-
  Please acknowledge this repository when using its code or results. The associated
  manuscript has been submitted to Internet of Things (Elsevier) and has not yet
  been accepted. If accepted, please also cite the article using its final
  publication details and DOI when available. Please cite the original UVA dataset
  when using its data. See README.md for citation details.
title: "Shared Temporal Models and Cross-Link Graphs for LoRaWAN RSSI Forecasting"
